{
  "type": "html",
  "title": "地址变换机构与快表教学动画",
  "html_content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>地址变换机构与快表</title>\n<style>\nbody{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5}\n.container{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px}\nh1{text-align:center;color:#333}\n.demo-area{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}\ncanvas{border:1px solid #ccc;background:white;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}\nbutton{padding:8px 16px;cursor:pointer;background:#4CAF50;color:white;border:none;border-radius:4px}\nbutton:hover{background:#45a049}\n.legend{margin-top:15px;font-size:14px;color:#666}\n.info-box{background:#e8f4fd;border-left:4px solid #2196F3;padding:10px;margin-top:15px;border-radius:4px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h1>地址变换机构与快表 (TLB)</h1>\n<div id=\"canvasContainer\" style=\"position:relative\"><canvas id=\"mainCanvas\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"info-box\" id=\"statusText\" style=\"display:none\">点击下方按钮查看两种模式的区别</div>\n<div>\n<button onclick=\"startDemo()\">▶ 自动演示</button>\n<button onclick=\"resetAnimation()\">↺ 重置</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"legend\">💡 黄色节点=TLB命中 | 蓝色节点=正常查询 | 红色叉号=缺失</div>\n</div>\n<script>\nconst canvas=document.getElementById('mainCanvas');\nconst ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');\nlet animating=false;\nlet phase=0;\nconst steps=[];\nfunction drawArrow(fromX,fromY,toX,toY){ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(fromX,fromY);ctx.lineTo(toX,toY);ctx.strokeStyle='#666';ctx.setLineDash([5]);ctx.stroke();ctx.setLineDash([]);}\nfunction clearCanvas(){ctx.clearRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);}\nfunction drawBox(x,y,w,h,label,color='#ddd'){\nctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.fillRect(x,y,w,h);ctx.strokeStyle='#999';ctx.strokeRect(x,y,w,h);\nctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.font='12px Arial';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillText(label,x+w/2,y+h/2+4);}\n// 初始状态\nclearCanvas();\ndrawBox(50,150,120,60,'CPU',null);\ndrawBox(200,150,120,60,'MMU',null);\ndrawBox(350,150,120,60,'Page Table',null);\ndrawBox(500,150,120,60,'Memory',null);\ndrawArrow(170,180,220,180);\ndrawArrow(320,180,370,180);\ndrawArrow(470,180,520,180);\ndocument.getElementById('statusText').innerHTML='普通模式：需两次访存<br><small>①查页表 → ②取数据</small>';\ndocument.getElementById('statusText').style.display='block';\n\nasync function startDemo(){animating=true;phase=0;steps.length=0;await runSteps();}\nfunction resetAnimation(){animating=false;phase=0;steps.length=0;clearCanvas();drawInitialState();}\nfunction drawInitialState(){clearCanvas();drawBox(50,150,120,60,'CPU',null);drawBox(200,150,120,60,'MMU',null);drawBox(350,150,120,60,'Page Table',null);drawBox(500,150,120,60,'Memory',null);drawArrow(170,180,220,180);drawArrow(320,180,370,180);drawArrow(470,180,520,180);}\nasync function runSteps(){while(animating&&phase<steps.length){await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,1500));const step=steps[phase++];switch(step.mode){case 'normal':animateNormal();break;case 'tlb':animateTLB();break}}\nif(!animating)drawFinalFrame();}\nfunction animateNormal(){clearCanvas();drawBox(50,150,120,60,'CPU',null);drawBox(200,150,120,60,'MMU',null);drawBox(350,150,120,60,'Page Table',null);drawBox(500,150,120,60,'Memory',null);drawArrow(170,180,220,180);drawArrow(320,180,370,180);drawArrow(470,180,520,180);ctx.fillStyle='red';ctx.font='bold 14px Arial';ctx.fillText('⚠️ 第1次访存：查页表',350,100);ctx.fillText('⏳ 等待...',350,130);}\nfunction animateTLB(){clearCanvas();drawBox(50,150,120,60,'CPU',null);drawBox(200,150,120,60,'MMU',null);drawBox(350,150,120,60,'Page Table',null);drawBox(500,150,120,60,'Memory',null);drawArrow(170,180,220,180);drawArrow(320,180,370,180);drawArrow(470,180,520,180);ctx.fillStyle='yellow';ctx.font='bold 14px Arial';ctx.fillText('✅ TLB命中！跳过查表',200,100);ctx.fillText('⚡ 直接访问物理地址',200,130);}\nfunction drawFinalFrame(){clearCanvas();drawBox(50,150,120,60,'CPU',null);drawBox(200,150,120,60,'MMU',null);drawBox(350,150,120,60,'Page Table',null);drawBox(500,150,120,60,'Memory',null);drawArrow(170,180,220,180);drawArrow(320,180,370,180);drawArrow(470,180,520,180);ctx.fillStyle='green';ctx.font='bold 14px Arial';ctx.fillText('📊 统计结果：TLB命中率 >90%',350,100);ctx.fillText('🚀 平均访问时间减少约一半',350,130);}\nwindow.addEventListener('load',()=>{});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "description": "通过对比实验展示基本地址变换机构（两次访存）与快表（TLB）加速机制的差异。动画分三步：1)普通模式下MMU依次访问页表和内存；2)快表命中时直接获取物理地址；3)统计结果显示TLB的高命中率优势。支持自动演示和手动重置。",
  "knowledge_base_quote": [
    "源于教材知识库：《存储器管理》地址变换机构与快表",
    "基本地址变换机构通过页表寄存器（存放页表起始地址和长度）实现地址变换。每次访问内存需两次：第一次访问页表，第二次访问数据。快表（TLB）是页表的高速缓存，存放最近访问的页表项，可加快地址变换速度。快表命中率可达90%以上。"
  ],
  "subtype": "animation"
}